            messages.Add("ac.mode.gentle.d", new string[2] { "CPU 低于正常优先级、磁盘 IO 低、内存页优先级 3，启用 EcoQoS；保留动态提优与计时器请求。对局中可核验的独立服务共享最多 4 个完整能效核或其他缓存域的核；同构辅助核为 2 个。CPU Sets 保持原值，有限纠偏，退局恢复绑核，关闭分组恢复资源设置。", "BelowNormal CPU, low disk IO, memory-page priority 3 and EcoQoS; preserves dynamic boosting and timer requests. During games, verified dedicated services share up to four complete efficiency or alternate-cache cores, or two homogeneous auxiliary cores. CPU Sets stay unchanged. Corrections are bounded; game exit restores affinity and disabling a group restores resource settings." });
            messages.Add("ac.mode.balanced.d", new string[2] { "CPU 低于正常优先级、磁盘 IO 极低、内存页优先级 2，启用 EcoQoS 并禁用 Windows 动态优先级提升；保留计时器请求。对局中可核验的独立服务共享 2 个完整能效核或辅助物理核。CPU Sets 保持原值，有限纠偏，退局恢复绑核，关闭或降档按原记录恢复。", "BelowNormal CPU, very-low disk IO, memory-page priority 2 and EcoQoS; disables Windows dynamic priority boosting while preserving timer requests. During games, verified dedicated services share two complete efficiency or auxiliary physical cores. CPU Sets stay unchanged. Corrections are bounded; game exit restores affinity and disabling or lowering the tier restores owned settings as appropriate." });
            messages.Add("ac.mode.isolated.d", new string[2] { "CPU Idle 优先级、磁盘 IO 极低、内存页优先级 1，启用 EcoQoS、禁用 Windows 动态优先级提升，系统支持时忽略该进程的高精度计时器请求。对局中可核验的独立服务共享 1 个完整能效核或辅助物理核，包含其 SMT 线程。每秒核验、有限纠偏，保留 CPU Sets；退局恢复绑核，关闭或降档按原记录恢复。过强压制可能增加游戏等待。", "Idle CPU, very-low disk IO, memory-page priority 1 and EcoQoS. Disables Windows dynamic priority boosting and ignores the process's high-resolution timer requests where supported. During games, verified dedicated services share one complete efficiency or auxiliary physical core, including SMT siblings. Checks once per second with bounded corrections and unchanged CPU Sets. Game exit restores affinity; disabling or lowering the tier restores owned settings as appropriate. Heavy suppression can increase game waits." });
